          "date": "2026-11-23 00:31:55.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-20253 idl: reserve rn_flags for renameat2() flags",
        "message": "LU-20253 idl: reserve rn_flags for renameat2() flags\n\nRename rn_padding_5 of mdt_rec_rename (rr_flags in mdt_rec_reint) to\nrn_flags, and define the MDS_RENAME_FL_NOREPLACE, _EXCHANGE and\n_WHITEOUT values it carries, the same as the renameat2() RENAME_*\nflags, sent only to an MDT with OBD_CONNECT2_RENAMEAT2.  A field of\nits own keeps these flags out of the 32-bit mds_op_bias, which has\nonly a few bits left.  Only the field name, the values and the wire\nchecks are added here so they can land before the feature patches.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I081f604ead67adc431224d559942a025ea3ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
